# The build context is this producer's own directory. Only the control templates
# are COPYed out of it: the shared copyright file arrives through the `family`
# named context and the binaries through `bin`, which is what keeps a cargo
# target directory of several gigabytes out of the path buildx has to walk.
#
# producer.env and prepare.sh are excluded deliberately. Neither is copied into
# the image, and leaving them in the context would invalidate this producer's
# cache whenever a build input that only the host reads was edited.
*
!control/*.control
